          "text": "From: Ava Lin <a.lin@northlab.org>\nTo: Research Team\nSubject: Centrifuge Training\nA required training session for the laboratory's new centrifuge will be held on Tuesday at 10:00 A.M. in Room B214. The session will last approximately one hour. Please bring your employee identification badge. Staff members who completed the manufacturer's online training last month do not need to attend. If you have a scheduling conflict, reply to this message by noon on Monday."
        }
